List the bundled catalog's motors, with the impulse, thrust and burn time their curves give

Usage: hpr motors list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --class <CLASS>
          Only this impulse class, such as H or 1/2A

      --json
          Print one JSON document on standard output instead of text, errors included

      --color <WHEN>
          When to use color. With auto, output to a terminal is colored, and NO_COLOR, FORCE_COLOR and CLICOLOR_FORCE are followed. JSON output never has color
          
          [default: auto]
          [possible values: auto, always, never]

      --diameter <MM>
          Only this casing diameter, mm (within 0.5 mm)

      --manufacturer <MANUFACTURER>
          Only this manufacturer: its name or abbreviation, any case

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version

Examples:
  List the catalog's 38 mm H motors:
      hpr motors list --class H --diameter 38
  List Cesaroni's motors:
      hpr motors list --manufacturer Cesaroni

Guide: https://hpr.fusionspace.co/cli.html#listing-the-catalog
